<title>SPAIN: Spain 1997 budget preparations &quot;going well&quot; - Rato.</title>
<headline>Spain 1997 budget preparations &quot;going well&quot; - Rato.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Thursday that the preparation of the 1997 budget draft was on schedule and &quot;going well&quot;.</p>
<p>Rato, speaking informally to journalists, said the budget draft would be ready for cabinet approval as planned on September 27.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
